#: scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a0a7311b482359cad8507b3a3c32a7a34a6a58a1f374c5755aa7e04805247a5
#. default-sha256: 6831902efaab978152f057942054b6d4e466675608f305677e5495f6368c1857
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Her once-porcelain skin was no longer even sickly pale; ⟪k:4⟫it was now the "
"bloodless color of dirt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫透き通るような白磁であった彼女の肌は、⟪k:4⟫病人の青白さすら保っておりません。"
"⟪k:5⟫もう血液を知らない土の色でございます。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8476e5593b88bbb4d48d921598c7da5d5f924116c3e493054d5e1ac59d9b0da
#. default-sha256: a82faedb132034366ae6d63062b7936be8a37c72424981873db295e13e2332b5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was sprawled haphazardly out on the cellar floor, dried blood stains around her half-"
"open mouth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は四肢を無残にも投げ出し、⟪k:1⟫ぽっかりと開いた唇から乾いた血を吐いております。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb41fde93278455a85ffc2c16facb7351cbc2abd02d6b63b25648fd09b8c54cf
#. default-sha256: 9348ba5769126d3eba51c99c8d24bc2cbc3fd183889c1dae283466f7b1991c64
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And those lips were, naturally, lacking their former rosen sheen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もちろんその唇も、⟪k:1⟫かつての薔薇色を留めておりません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e52926037495fddad71214375561434c5b23e9591aa580725e4d876f105ae42
#. default-sha256: 35ac2dd5c5871bea049ab3e8a5ac1db285afbfd882b0fefa3ee501cc06660cd1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her body was covered with an array of wounds, but the most prominent was the man’s singular "
"sword standing tall in her chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女の身体にはいくつか傷がありましたが、⟪k:1⟫一番目立ったのは、⟪k:2⟫胸元にそびえ立つ例の不思"
"議な剣でございます。"

