msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_83059EA1_5DA0_4439_9CF7_8FDEC8492F2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is your essence. ⟪k:1⟫The real you hidden beneath the mask of sincerity. ⟪k:2⟫The true "
"beast was your heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それがあなたの本性。⟪k:1⟫誠実な仮面に隠したあなたの正体。⟪k:2⟫獣というのは、⟪k:3⟫まさしくあな"
"たの心であったのでしょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D138DAE7_5A54_4526_8D38_E50F0F258A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a299e21e89f08dc0f156ad2802cfaed32d04bcdafbeb7b17e3c8a898cd147c6
