msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4E49F3B_D9CA_427E_B899_1389FEB24806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫wanted⟪k:2⟫ to be a brutal, savage murderer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫人殺しの獣でいたかったのは、⟪k:1⟫自分でございましょう……？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb2ac5ae31e1147cd221753440e7fe54b122200c19e98ea9ef2e7c87cd1d8ba5
#. default-sha256: 739750bd0021ff4c38c639e837a92900ddff9b9472889d9be0cfda409f81b3bd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You never really ⟪k:1⟫loved⟪k:2⟫ the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or the black-haired woman, "
"for that matter. ⟪k:5⟫You were merely attached to them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたは――白い髪の娘のことも、⟪k:1⟫黒髪の女性のことも、⟪k:2⟫愛してはいなかったのでしょうね。"
"⟪k:3⟫あなたにあったのは強い執着のみ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf18ce32ca28e54c91350a93e19652f5e7a333333e188907e40f88d60c9573da
#. default-sha256: 18cabef68fd4a0ce164afe40b696a52621442d67b8973985ea8b5dd1eab7fff4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fixated on the idea of a world of tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫平穏という、⟪k:1⟫世界への。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab983464a4809190045b75fd1832a43efa95d3ba11d9a3e4ce4edfba76c60bbd
#. default-sha256: 63713d326257770b8a4019d3f2e067f30dfdebd5c11370c2be4e3b9cd930ef92
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You used this peace to anchor yourself, to prevent you from drifting off into the ocean of "
"your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You yearned to cause pain..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたは欲望に攫われそうになる自分自身を、⟪k:1⟫平穏で繋ぎとめようとしていた。⟪k:2⟫あなたは"
"ずっと誰かを傷つけたいと願いながらも――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d8b9d814e758dba4db4a2d33f5b29e8143d54ebe1591ff92dd192a0035828fb
#. default-sha256: 66d75f84af43c3dd2b131d9dea75acd49367c17c9bf20c3787e6abaf886b272f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫while also hungering for the opposite—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a calm life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫真逆となる平和な日常も渇望していたはずですわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8e0ebc2674abf2f84c22036a9f918ac249beffb24bf413a0403f92d259e0327
#. default-sha256: 03dee69d76dcb610850f9d665e4d940319fd39553aac8f3b0aa561bbd79a0495
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You idolized this idealized life, spent in quiet harmony with another, because you knew just "
"how difficult it would be for you to attain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫穏やかな人と共に見る世界に――憧れていたのでしょう？⟪k:1⟫　それが自分にとって、⟪k:2⟫どれほど得"
"難いものなのか心の底で理解していたから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0657425936756828aa451ca58f7cc07fdc8ace787f132e60dae75b9415d64236
#. default-sha256: 6514480b6f00a0bf07a833b7d8f92b1229c57c0c70df0883ef108a2adaf23b42
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Far more difficult for you than satisfying your cravings—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but not impossible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたにとっては欲望に落ちるよりも、⟪k:1⟫困難な道であったはずです。⟪k:2⟫けれど、⟪k:3⟫不可能で"
"はなかったのではありませんか？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4893179c727b3268d729588410b9c2cb406c4165c46c9c9b22c4535bfdbd032f
#. default-sha256: 2e07c84f439bf5a8499f5e987e7c9e428c42c16ee8140b49afb728316a713221
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, had hoped you would find peace with someone rather than descend into savagery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしは、⟪k:1⟫あなたが獣に落ちることよりも――、⟪k:2⟫誰かと平穏に生きていただく方を望んでお"
"りましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9a281a0f3023ac9fc7fe1127f67d2389ae5df5bd686e9ff2ce463ff55b8c6b4
#. default-sha256: 2e0d30170d6d4f264409a7cbdfe8270989134b14ed53605c2684dcd126488fb4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It may have only been superficial...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but it would have been very human."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫たとえそれが、⟪k:1⟫仮面の上に成り立つものであっても……⟪k:2⟫ずいぶんと人間的ではありませんか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12319578808bc67f237010384c9d5ea7634c9b758d4dec618d38d38a0d53ea51
#. default-sha256: de0993cd0e7eb5439eb0aba78e1e2fef4f73c683d2549715181741b9aac3a83a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But ultimately, peace slipped through your fingers..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし結局は……、⟪k:1⟫あなたの平穏は失われ――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf942f2d9680aec0d88795e8559c9b924a12d452539960e13994847858cf5739
#. default-sha256: 82029b5497d6057e6358d978dfdaaf77b39fa469f5f385896d3ffee8ef59671a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and no one was left to suppress your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You cannot, after all, hold them back "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その欲望を止める者は、⟪k:1⟫もう誰もいなくなったのです。⟪k:2⟫だって、⟪k:3⟫あなた自身では止めら"
"れようもないのでしょう？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_03D04C05_B7DF_4E7B_A9FB_9B8158470996
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acb4bd80e7415c080a8ec1190f029b1b0bdf87a55e365a33b3a5c416f3cce2b5
